      "description": "A connected route line with a reserved brand gradient for active trip progress.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-route-progress\"><span class=\"ds-stop ds-passed\">1</span><span class=\"ds-route-segment\"></span><span class=\"ds-stop ds-next\">2</span><span class=\"ds-route-segment\"></span><span class=\"ds-stop ds-destination\">3</span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-route-progress{display:flex;align-items:center;width:100%;min-height:24px}.ds-stop{display:grid;place-items:center;width:22px;height:22px;border:2px solid #566D86;border-radius:50%;font:700 10px system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-passed,.ds-next{color:#FFFFFF;background:#0869A8;border-color:#0869A8}.ds-destination{color:#07182F;background:#FFFFFF;border-color:#0869A8}.ds-route-segment{height:2px;flex:1;background:#D7E2ED}.ds-passed+.ds-route-segment{background:#0869A8}.ds-active-progress{height:3px;background-image:linear-gradient(105deg,#0B3B88 0%,#0869A8 48%,#00D3C5 100%)}"
